  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview 4 adds the 'alwasp tools update' command for checking and downloading newer\n      AL compiler tools. Config-driven builds now write resolved defines to each project's\n      app.json preprocessorSymbols during the build/restore cycle, allowing projects that\n      differ only by defines to compile in the same workspace invocation while preserving\n      existing app.json symbols. This release also fixes app.json serialization for\n      preprocessorSymbols on runtimes that require an explicit JSON type info resolver.\n      See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
